 "bodyHtml": "<a class=\"wd-skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<h1 id=\"order-total\">Order total</h1>\n<p>Pick a quantity and a price. The total includes 8% tax, rounded to the nearest cent. Trust this document to turn the pickers on.</p>\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"qty\":1}</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"price\":12.99}</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"taxrate\":8}</script>\n<select data-wd-bind-input=\"qty\" aria-label=\"Qty\"><option value=\"1\" selected>1</option><option value=\"2\">2</option><option value=\"5\">5</option></select>\n<div class=\"wd-radios\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Price\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"price\" value=\"12.99\" data-wd-bind-input=\"price\" checked> 12.99</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"price\" value=\"24.5\" data-wd-bind-input=\"price\"> 24.5</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"price\" value=\"40\" data-wd-bind-input=\"price\"> 40</label></div>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"exact\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;*&quot;,[&quot;*&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;qty&quot;],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;price&quot;]],[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;L&quot;,100],[&quot;u-&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;taxrate&quot;]]]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"exact\":1402.92}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"half\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;exact&quot;],[&quot;u-&quot;,[&quot;L&quot;,0.5]]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"half\":1403.42}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"cents\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;half&quot;],[&quot;%&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;half&quot;],[&quot;L&quot;,1]]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"cents\":1403}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"total\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;/&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;cents&quot;],[&quot;L&quot;,100]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"total\":14.03}</script>\n<p>Total with tax: <span data-wd-bind=\"total\">14.03</span> for <span data-wd-bind=\"qty\">1</span> at <span data-wd-bind=\"price\">12.99</span> each.</p>\n<p>Choices and totals are temporary preview state. They are not saved into the file.</p>\n\n</main>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/__wd/runtime.js\"></script>",
